name: Te lucis ante terminum;
office-part: Hymnus;
mode: 4;
book: Completorium O.P. (Suarez, 1949), p. 9: Sabbatis et Dominicis Adventus; melody GregoBase 9952 (Antiphonarium O.P. 1933, Gillet), stanzas 2-3 to the same melody;
